WORKER_TEST_RULE = "When you hand in your work, the journal judges and tests it for you. In a plan or batch that happens only at the end of the phase or batch, so hand in and go on with your next task; a failure comes back to you. Run a test yourself only when you need it: only your new tests or the tests your change affects, in small batches so you can iterate quickly. Never run the full test suite: a worker that does is refused and reported."
